---
import {makeLessons} from '../../public/chem/simple-lessons.js';
const lessons=makeLessons(),lesson=lessons[0],first=lesson.steps[0];
---
<section id="start" class="simple-study">
  <p class="eyebrow">CHEM 004 · Learning Check 2</p>
  <h1>Chemistry, one step at a time.</h1>
  <p class="simple-intro">Pick a topic. Follow one example. Try one question.</p>
  <label class="simple-topic-label">What would you like help with?<select id="simple-topic">{lessons.map(item=><option value={item.id} selected={item.id===lesson.id}>{item.title}</option>)}</select></label>
  <div class="simple-lesson" aria-labelledby="simple-title">
    <h2 id="simple-title">{lesson.title.replace(/^\d+\. /,'')}</h2>
    <div class="simple-scenario"><p><span>YOU HAVE</span><strong id="simple-given">{lesson.given}</strong></p><p><span>YOU WANT</span><strong id="simple-wanted">{lesson.wanted}</strong></p></div>
    <p id="simple-progress" class="simple-progress" role="status">Step 1 of {lesson.steps.length}</p>
    <div id="simple-step">
      <h3 id="simple-step-title" tabindex="-1">{first.title}</h3>
      <p id="simple-why">{first.why}</p>
      <figure id="simple-sketch" hidden></figure>
      <pre id="simple-work" aria-label="Worked step">{first.work}</pre>
    </div>
    <div id="simple-quiz" hidden>
      <fieldset><legend id="simple-question" tabindex="-1"></legend><div id="simple-options"></div></fieldset>
      <button type="button" id="simple-check">Check my answer</button>
      <p id="simple-feedback" role="status" hidden></p>
      <button type="button" id="simple-next-topic">Next topic →</button>
    </div>
    <div class="simple-actions"><button type="button" id="simple-prev" disabled>← Back</button><button type="button" id="simple-next" class="primary">Next step →</button></div>
    <details id="simple-terms-detail"><summary>What do these words mean?</summary><p id="simple-terms">{lesson.terms}</p></details>
    <details id="simple-lecture-detail" class="simple-note-emphasis"><summary id="simple-lecture-label">Gold · lecture emphasis / method</summary><div id="simple-lecture-content"></div></details>
    <div class="simple-secondary"><button type="button" id="simple-restart">Restart this example</button><button type="button" id="simple-new-example">New example values</button><a id="simple-reference" href="#particles">More detail, when you need it →</a></div>
  </div>
  <details class="simple-scope"><summary>What does this cover?</summary><p>Based on supplied Lectures 1–7, notes 1–4 and Activities 3–6. Your exam is Thursday, October 22. October 20’s lecture and Activities 7–8 were not supplied. This is an independent study guide; the instructor’s official scope takes priority.</p><p>Purple means an exact transcript quote. Gold means a paraphrase of lecture emphasis or a worked method. Open the lecture note to see the source.</p></details>
  <noscript><p>Step buttons need JavaScript. Open the full reference below for the complete worked examples.</p></noscript>
</section>
